From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:53:00 +0000
Subject: fix(ios): fail closed on invalid render view methods

respondsToSelector: can report true right before dispatch raises
unrecognized selector, so the layer handler now captures the concrete
Method/IMP from the receiver's class, rejects forwarding-only or
ABI-mismatched methods, and invokes the captured IMP directly. Rejections
and predicate disagreements are logged with a content-free receipt.

Fork-Patch: ios-render-view-method-invoker
Origin: botiverse/KuiklyUI#128 c75b3eca0a4a1c04cf01ebe669a7a9c3ed9b3c0f
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

